    "summary": "Base-exact anchored logit averaging was verified on 4,096 fresh reachable states from the three frozen 65k checkpoints. It reproduced the old 64-logit illegal-sentinel artifact, reduced repaired all-slot max residual to 0.243367, retained the same legal max, changed legal logits by at most 3.81e-6, and matched all 4,096 greedy actions. All 255 tests passed.",
